# Rust / Tauri
target/
apps/desktop/src-tauri/target/
# Cargo.lock IS committed. JKY Terminal is an application, not a library, and a
# committed lockfile is what makes builds reproducible and `cargo audit` results
# meaningful for the versions users actually run.

